              "id": "1771441367153_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "sourceSegmentNameMismatch: {{$context.$nodes.KPI_VALIDATOR.$output.sourceSegmentNameMismatch}} \nbaseObjectDifferent: {{$context.$nodes.KPI_VALIDATOR.$output.baseObjectDifferent}} \nisTargetSegmentExist: {{$context.$nodes.KPI_VALIDATOR.$output.isTargetSegmentExist}} \nisNotMaterialized: {{$context.$nodes.KPI_VALIDATOR.$output.targetSegmentNotMaterialized}} \nDo not make any inference and strictly follow below rules and display the mentioned results :-\n\nIf isTargetSegmentExist value is FALSE  then display  \"Target segment does not exist\" and return.\nIf sourceSegmentNameMismatch value is TRUE  then display  \"Source segment name does not match with current segment\" and return.\nIf baseObjectDifferent value is TRUE  then display  \"Segment comparison is supported only with other segments of Accounts Profile Type\" and return.\nIf isNotMaterialized value is TRUE  then display  \"Segment comparison is supported only with other pre-calculated segments\" and return.\nElse display \"Please check Segment name\"\n\nAlways display below HTML \n<br></br><p>Type <strong>&lsquo;Help&rsquo;</strong> to view usage guidelines, explore supported dimensions and metrics, or see sample questions.</p>"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
